  <p id="c-sanguozhi-057-jin076-yufei:ding" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-jin076-yufei:ding:m0000" ref="uxk_94s_ndu">固</persName>与<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-jin076-yufei:ding:m0002" ref="61q_ogq_ueq">陆凯</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-jin076-yufei:ding:m0005" ref="edv_7cp_cl8">孟宗</persName>同心忧国，年七十六卒。子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-jin076-yufei:ding:m0019" ref="uxk_94s_ndu_A">弥</persName>，字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-jin076-yufei:ding:m0022" ref="uxk_94s_ndu_A">钦远</persName>，仕晋，至梁州刺史。孙<persName id="c-sanguozhi-057-jin076-yufei:ding:m0035" ref="o9i_f7k_d6z">潭</persName>，光禄大夫。</p>
